Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:19:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] fix: authenticate pinned remote-pairing peers before client
 proof

Pin SRP-authenticated peer identity, verify M2 before signing M3, reject non-contributory key exchange, and never silently enroll on verification failure. Legacy records require explicit re-pairing.

Class: upstream-bug
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-10-23-pairing-hardening.md
Offered-upstream: not yet; iOS compatibility verification in progress
